 "page": [
  {
   "kind": "town",
   "label": "town",
   "section": "header",
   "text": "Rundgate · city · germanic · threat frontier · route road · terrain river · seed sim-city"
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "historicalCharacter",
   "section": "identity",
   "text": "Everything before the Occupation is referred to as 'the old settlement'. What exists now was built after, by different people, with different assumptions, over different rubble"
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-GEN-13",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.market",
   "pool": "MARKET-OPEN",
   "section": "site",
   "text": "Market day is Rundgate at its truest: the roads bring the custom, and the custom is the argument for the stalls.",
   "vid": 0
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-GEN-17",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.institutions",
   "pool": "GARRISONED",
   "section": "site",
   "text": "Armed order is part of Rundgate's furniture; the town keeps professionals for its safety rather than trusting to luck and neighbours.",
   "vid": 0
  },
  {
   "kind": "badge",
   "label": "prosperity",
   "section": "health",
   "text": "Prosperous"
  },
  {
   "kind": "badge",
   "label": "safetyLabel",
   "section": "health",
   "text": "Moderate"
  },
  {
   "kind": "badge",
   "label": "readiness",
   "section": "health",
   "text": "Well-Defended"
  },
  {
   "kind": "badge",
   "label": "foodSecurity",
   "section": "health",
   "text": "Secure"
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-GEN-3",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.systemsHealth",
   "pool": "prosperity: Comfortable / Prosperous",
   "section": "health",
   "text": "People in Rundgate can afford to argue about things other than money.",
   "vid": 2
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-GEN-3",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.systemsHealth",
   "pool": "economicViability.viable: true",
   "section": "health",
   "text": "Rundgate expects to go on being Rundgate.",
   "vid": 2
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-GEN-3",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.systemsHealth",
   "pool": "defenseProfile.readiness.label: Well-Defended",
   "section": "health",
   "text": "Rundgate is defended properly rather than impressively: the works are sound and none of them are for show.",
   "vid": 0
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-GEN-3",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.systemsHealth",
   "pool": "scores.military: STRONG",
   "section": "health",
   "text": "Rundgate can put a real body of armed men on its walls, and the men look like they have done it before.",
   "vid": 0
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-GEN-3",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.systemsHealth",
   "pool": "scores.monster: STRONG",
   "section": "health",
   "text": "Children in Rundgate are taught the rules about the dark early, and the rules work.",
   "vid": 2
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-GEN-3",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.systemsHealth",
   "pool": "scores.internal: ADEQUATE",
   "section": "health",
   "text": "The watch at Rundgate answers what is reported to it and does not seek out what is not.",
   "vid": 1
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-GEN-3",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.systemsHealth",
   "pool": "scores.economic: STRONG",
   "section": "health",
   "text": "Prices in Rundgate are steady in a way that suggests the town is not living on the last thing that sold.",
   "vid": 1
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-GEN-3",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.systemsHealth",
   "pool": "scores.magical: ADEQUATE",
   "section": "health",
   "text": "Rundgate has somebody who can do what is usually needed and knows what is beyond them.",
   "vid": 0
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-GEN-3",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.systemsHealth",
   "pool": "foodSecurity.label: Secure",
   "section": "health",
   "text": "Nobody in Rundgate thinks about food, which is the most that can be said for a town's food.",
   "vid": 1
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "arrivalScene",
   "section": "situation",
   "text": "Rundgate is neither impressive nor disappointing from the approach. It is what it is, which is a working settlement of reasonable size doing reasonable things. A city, properly speaking: dense, layered, too large to take in at once. Steep roofs, enclosed craft yards, and carved lintels mark the older wards. A magelight lamp post marks the main gate. The cathedral bell tower is the first thing visible from this direction. Rundgate appears around a bend in the road, its walls and towers coming into view all at once."
  },
  {
   "kind": "machine",
   "label": "pressureSentence",
   "section": "situation",
   "text": "Nora Jäger's relationship with Tangmar Werner is more complicated than their public roles suggest. A document each believed only they possessed has surfaced in a third set of hands."
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-GEN-5",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.situation",
   "pool": "ordinary (route road and the default)",
   "section": "situation",
   "text": "Rundgate is on the way to somewhere and has made a modest living out of being on the way.",
   "vid": 1
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-GEN-6",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.origin",
   "pool": "road",
   "section": "origin",
   "text": "What Rundgate cannot grow, the road brings, and the road is therefore not a convenience for this town but a condition of it.",
   "vid": 2
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-GEN-6",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.origin",
   "pool": "tier overlay: city",
   "section": "origin",
   "text": "Rundgate is big enough to have quarters that do not know each other.",
   "vid": 2
  },
  {
   "block": "DS-REL-2",
   "face": 0,
   "kind": "composed",
   "mount": "overview.notableConnection",
   "pool": "flagDriven count zero",
   "section": "connection",
   "text": "Rundgate has had pressures enough to bend its relationships and they have not bent; the ties here are what they would be anywhere.",
   "vid": 3
  },
  {
   "kind": "roster",
   "label": "institutions",
   "section": "institutions",
   "text": "institutions: City granaries, Multiple market squares, Daily markets, Inns and taverns (district), Major annual fairs, Banking houses, Merchant guilds (15-40), Craft guilds (30-80), Warehouse district, Cartographer's guild, Apothecary district, Furrier's district, Listening post, Specialized metalworkers, Luxury goods quarter, Cathedral (10,000+ only), Multiple monasteries, Parish churches (10-30), Burial grounds and charnel house, Mayor and council, City walls and gates, Professional city watch, Garrison, Citadel, Mages' guild, Alchemist quarter, Multiple criminal factions, Black market, Gambling halls, Brothel (red light district), Fighting pits, Multiple adventurers' guilds, Mercenary quarter, Dungeon delving supply district, Sage's quarter, City hall, Multiple courthouses, Housing (1000-5000 structures), Aqueduct or water system, Annual fair, Public bathhouse, Post relay station, Blacksmiths (3-10), Smelter, Ropemaker, Almshouse, Bardic college"
  }
 ],
